        "filing_date": "2025-10-14",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Pursuant to these laws and regulations, we may also be required to develop and implement spill prevention, control and countermeasure plans, also referred to as “SPCC plans,” in connection with on-site storage of significant quantities of oil.",
